## GITHUB AUTH FIX

```bash
# Clear invalid token
unset GITHUB_TOKEN

# Login fresh
gh auth login
# Select: github.com
# Auth method: Paste token (or browser)
# SSH key: Yes
```

Then push:
```bash
cd fin-023-investment-portfolio-ai
git push -u origin main
```
